  "fixtureConditioning": "Tiny poison suppresses recovery; native pet resistance fixtures reset after reload, ordinary auto-stable/claim preserved. Only saved inspection deadlines held five minutes, natural50/51-frame runtime cadence unchanged. Isolated consumer cases copy valid leases to additional NPCs without changing production recipient filters. Deterministic native hit seam restored immediately.",
  "open": [
    "Known item integration gap: existing GemCombat item thorns/light-thorns callback remains after positive life loss. Source flat item+aura stat aggregation and one-packet mitigation/attack-attempt ordering are not yet unified; do not clear related item gates or class acceptance.",
